# S15: Work-Control Authentication

## Objective

Add opt-in auth (`nuxt-auth-utils`) to work-control. GitHub OAuth (plus optional
email magic-link). `wc_chats.owner_id` becomes a real user ID. Chat list scoped
to authenticated user. Presence `PresenceMember.label` shows real user name.
Board still viewable by anyone with the URL (share-by-link, S-future RBAC).

## Prerequisites

- S14 CLOSED (CI green, typecheck clean)
- `nuxt-auth-utils` already in `core` (used by other apps)
- ADR: auth is opt-in per app (`apps/*/nuxt.config.ts` adds module)

## Tasks

- [ ] S15-T01-FreezeInvariants.pd
- [ ] S15-T02-AuthModule.pd            — add nuxt-auth-utils to work-control
- [ ] S15-T03-OAuthRoute.pd            — GitHub OAuth + session
- [ ] S15-T04-UserScopedChats.pd       — chat list = my chats; owner_id from session
- [ ] S15-T05-PresenceIdentity.pd      — real name in PresenceMember after login
- [ ] S15-T06-UserMenuUi.pd            — CoreUserMenu + avatar in work-control header
- [ ] S15-T07-KnowledgeAuthUpdate.pd   — update work-control + authentication slugs
- [ ] S15-T08-TestsSmoke.pd

## Definition of Done

- [ ] Unauthenticated: redirect to login (or guest read-only view)
- [ ] GitHub OAuth: login → see own chats → create chat → scoped to user
- [ ] Presence: shows real GitHub username / avatar
- [ ] `bun run test` green, no auth-bypass paths

## App-agent protocol

All tasks follow `APP-AGENT-PROTOCOL.md`.

